---
source: crates/tds_cli/tests/ui.rs
description: "fn main():\n    let n = 3\n    if n:\n        print(n)\n"
---
error[TDS0212]: `if` condition must be a `Bool`
  ┌─ TDS0212-condition-not-bool.tds:3:8
  │
3 │     if n:
  │        ^ this has type `Int`
  │
  = note: TDS doesn't treat numbers, strings or lists as true or false
  = help: compare it explicitly, like `x != 0`
